# Play test of Longpier Haven (CIPlay longpier_haven, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: along the pier, the harbour
# master's chest, over the bridge to the stack and the watch hut's chest, the sunk boat's chest, the smugglers' cave, the
# boars and the puffers. Points as in its recipe.
island Longpier Haven
offset 0.9253 0.0291
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Puffer fish 2
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Warthog
kill Puffer fish
# Along the pier to its head
walk 0 -42 to 0 -48 to 0 -55 h=1.5 below=4
# Into the harbour master's cabin, his chest
walk -6.75 -36 to -6.75 -34 to -6.75 -32 h=1.7 below=4
open Harbour master's chest
# Over the bridge to the stack, into the watch hut
walk 40 2 to 46 2 to 52 2 to 57.5 2 h=3.1 below=5
walk 60.75 -1.5 to 60.75 0 to 60.75 2 h=3.2 below=5
open Chest in the watch hut
# Down to the boat sunk in the bay
at 24.5 -60
open The sunk boat's chest
# Into the smugglers' cave
walk -29 34 to -29 28 to -29 23 h=2.1 below=3
open Smugglers' chest
dig
